{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003846","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003846"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003846","label":"盤庚（伍胥列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"盤庚","mention_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0112"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0112","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p018","quote":"盤庚"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"盤庚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003846","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji066-039","person_id":"cbr-p003846","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["盤庚"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p018","quote":"其後四年，吳王將北伐齊，越王句踐用子貢之謀，乃率其眾以助吳，而重寶以獻遺太宰嚭。太宰嚭既數受越賂，其愛信越殊甚，日夜為言於吳王。吳王信用嚭之計。伍子胥諫曰：「夫越，腹心之病，今信其浮辭詐偽而貪齊。破齊，譬猶石田，無所用之。且盤庚之誥曰：『有顛越不恭，劓殄滅之，俾無遺育，無使易種于茲邑。』此商之所以興。願王釋齊而先越；若不然，後將悔之無及。」而吳王不聽，使子胥於齊。子胥臨行，謂其子曰：「吾數諫王，王不用，吾今見吳之亡矣。汝與吳俱亡，無益也。」乃屬其子於齊鮑牧，而還報吳。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名及局部敘事暫接異稱：公子光自立為闔廬、軫立為昭王、勝號白公；王稱隨敘事主體分段。王子綦佯充王不接昭王，與後文司馬子綦暫分候選但不斷言異人。悼公與陽生按本文分存，矛盾待版本覆核；鮑氏不強接鮑牧。未名父子只按本段明示保存，不補姓名。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p018","text":"其後四年，吳王將北伐齊，越王句踐用子貢之謀，乃率其眾以助吳，而重寶以獻遺太宰嚭。太宰嚭既數受越賂，其愛信越殊甚，日夜為言於吳王。吳王信用嚭之計。伍子胥諫曰：「夫越，腹心之病，今信其浮辭詐偽而貪齊。破齊，譬猶石田，無所用之。且盤庚之誥曰：『有顛越不恭，劓殄滅之，俾無遺育，無使易種于茲邑。』此商之所以興。願王釋齊而先越；若不然，後將悔之無及。」而吳王不聽，使子胥於齊。子胥臨行，謂其子曰：「吾數諫王，王不用，吾今見吳之亡矣。汝與吳俱亡，無益也。」乃屬其子於齊鮑牧，而還報吳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"越王句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003842","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"子貢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003845","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"其眾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"太宰嚭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003831","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"太宰嚭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003831","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"嚭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003831","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"盤庚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003846","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"